        "description": "The Vastu Yantra is a powerful yantra used to remove Vastu doshas and bring peace and harmony to the home or workplace. This yantra represents the Vastu Purush, the deity of Vastu Shastra. Worshipping the Vastu Yantra is believed to remove all Vastu doshas, bring peace, and ensure prosperity and happiness.",
        "hover": "The Vastu Yantra is a powerful yantra used to remove Vastu doshas and bring peace and harmony to the home or workplace. This yantra represents the Vastu Purush, the deity of Vastu Shastra. Worshipping the Vastu Yantra is believed to remove all Vastu doshas, bring peace, and ensure prosperity and happiness.",
        "deity": "Vastu Purush",
        "benefits": [
          "Removal of all Vastu doshas",
          "Attainment of peace and harmony in the home",
          "Prosperity and abundance",
          "Protection from all dangers",
          "Spiritual blessings",
          "Success in all endeavors",
          "Happiness and well-being in the family",
          "Attainment of all desires"
        ],
        "text": "",
        "meaning": "",
        "how": "Place the yantra in a clean place in the center of the house or North East corner. Perform a small puja with incense, lamp, and flowers. Chant the Vastu mantra (Om Vastu Purushaya Namah) 108 times. Meditate on the yantra's form.",
        "duration": "",
        "best_time": "",
        "steps": "",
        "verses": "",
